 vention (AFSP) invites Vermonters aged 18+ to be part of the pilot present
 ation of Pride Pathways: Suicide Prevention for LGBTQ+ Communities and All
 ies\, a 90-minute program designed to deepen understanding of how suicide 
 impacts the LGBTQ+ community and how each of us can help foster supportive
 \, inclusive\, and affirming environments that promote LGBTQ+ mental healt
 h. Virtual\n\nSources: Vermont Public
