BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Maple Tree Place FREE Concert on the Green Presenting Bon Pois
 on Ultimate Bon Jovi & Poison Double Tribute!
DTSTART:20260820T180000
DTEND:20260820T200000
DTSTAMP:20260820T114809Z
UID:d2c8348c507631672369a0673d72f2@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:East Coast's Ultimate Bon Jovi & Poison Double Tribute! Full c
 ostumes\, full production\, two complete shows\, one explosive night of pu
 re 80s arena rock! The Bon Poison experience will have you moving and groo
 ving all night long\, in this unforgettable tribute performance at Maple T
 ree Place On The Green. Bring your chairs\, blankets\, and come early to c
 heck out all the changes here at MTP. New stores include J. Crew Factory\,
  Bob’s Discount Furniture\, Boot Barn\, and Four Sisters. This is a grea
 t time for the entire family\; choose from a variety of tasty dining optio
 ns with outdoor seating at Grazers and McGillicuddy’s\, or cool down wit
 h some FroYo\, from Yogurt City. You can also order your meal to go On The
  Green while you enjoy the show! As always\, Vermont weather may be a fact
 or down the road\, so we will do our best to keep everyone in the loop if 
 any delays or reschedules are needed.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Maple Tree Place\, 28 Walnut Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/the-maple-
 tree-place-free-concert-on-the-green-presenting-bon-poison-ultimate-bon-jo
 vi-poison-double-tribute-29-07-2026-22-31-35
END:VEVENT
