BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Samurai and the Prisoner
DTSTART:20260821T150000
DTEND:20260821T173000
DTSTAMP:20260820T114809Z
UID:19939120cfa0818e4175a56996b88a@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:When Lord Murashige (Masahiro Motoki) rises up against the tyr
 annical Oda (Bando Shingo)\, he finds himself besieged within the walls of
  his own castle. Isolated\, he is confronted with a series of mysterious c
 rimes that shatter the fragile order of his court\, plunging the fortress 
 into fear and suspicion. With Oda’s army closing in and a traitor hiding
  among his ranks\, Murashige is forced into an uneasy alliance with Kanbei
  Kuroda (Masaki Suda)\, a brilliant yet dangerous strategist held prisoner
  in the dungeon. Helped by his wife Chiyoho (Yuriko Yoshitaka) and his mos
 t loyal generals\, Murashige must uncover the truth before the castle fall
 s. The Samurai and the Prisoner is also showing on August 21 at 7 pm in th
 e Film House at Main Street Landing.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Film House at Main Street Landing\, 60 Lake Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/the-samura
 i-and-the-prisoner-11-08-2026-15-08-18
END:VEVENT
